     Section 3(a) and (b)); and

  b. to the extent the database in which the Licensed Material is
     included is protected by Copyright and Similar Rights, then Your
     exercise of those rights must be solely as permitted by this
     Public License (including Section 3(a) and (b)).

For the avoidance of doubt, this Section 4 supplements and does not
replace Your obligations under Section 3 when the Licensed Material is
subject to Copyright and Similar Rights.

